  "_comment": "Curated by hand: which providers the product offers, in this order, at the base URL of their own documentation. generate_presets.py adds the chat models the models.dev catalogue knows for each \"source\" (newest first, up to maxModels, without what excludeModels names; for OpenRouter the newest perVendor models of each of its vendors). Where the catalogue has the provider it decides the model facts, and pinnedModels only forces a model in. Local servers have no source: what is installed there is listed by Fetch models.",
